  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 2202.14 Subordinate certificate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 2202.14 “Subordinate certificate” means a certification issued to an individual who:\n\n(a) Meets the requirements for initial or renewal certification, as applicable; and\n\n(b) Is or will be employed by a commercial applicator holding a master certificate.\n\nSource. #12530, eff 6-1-18; ss by #13982, eff 5-24-24 (formerly Env-Wq 2202.11)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq2200.html"
